@{ var isDashboard = ViewBag.CropPage != null; }
<footer class="atlas-footer @(isDashboard ? "" : "compact-footer")">
    <div class="footer-main">
        <div class="footer-story"><span class="footer-kicker">PAKISTAN CROP ATLAS</span><h2>Every field.<br /><span>A bigger story.</span></h2><p>Connecting Pakistan’s harvest to the people and places behind it.</p><div class="footer-crops" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-icons.svg#wheat")"></use></svg><svg><use href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-icons.svg#rice")"></use></svg><svg><use href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-icons.svg#cotton")"></use></svg><svg><use href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-icons.svg#maize")"></use></svg></div></div>
        <div class="footer-reading"><h3>Read the numbers</h3><p>Area and production use their reported source scales. Cotton production must not be interpreted as tonnes.</p><div class="footer-formula"><span>YIELD</span><strong>Production <i>÷</i> Area</strong></div><p class="footer-small">Missing inputs or zero area produce no yield value.</p></div>
        <div class="footer-geography"><h3>Keep the places in context</h3><div class="footer-region-tags"><span>Karachi <b>7 districts</b></span><span>Chitral <b>2 districts</b></span><span>Kohistan <b>3 districts</b></span></div><p>Combined observations remain combined. Historical comparisons reflect available reporting areas and changing boundaries.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom"><span><span class="live-dot"></span>Source: Pakistan Bureau of Statistics</span><span class="footer-credit">Crop statistics · Pakistan</span><a href="#page-top">Back to top <svg class="shell-icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="@Url.Content("~/Content/crop-icons.svg#shell-up")"></use></svg></a></div>
</footer>
